cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you utilize this computational engine, methodology, or evidence synthesis pipeline in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Reproducible Frequentist Network Meta-Analysis Framework (Multi-Treatment Evidence Synthesis)"
abstract: "A modular, reproducible computational workflow written in R (netmeta) demonstrating Network Meta-Analysis using a synthetic benchmark dataset. Features 12 analytical R scripts for model fitting, consistency checks, sensitivity analyses, and 14 publication-style visual exhibits."
